<h2 class='date-header'><span>17/09/2026</span></h2>

          <div class="date-posts">
        
<div class='post-outer'>
<div class='post hentry uncustomized-post-template' itemprop='blogPost' itemscope='itemscope' itemtype='http://schema.org/BlogPosting'>
<meta content='https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0N__rYpJ03Mi81jMYTz35HZk0MQKpkZRPIIrwhwYpBuvQpOH0F04_lMid-7N7mg2xaCik2_CKHXyxkFPAUgYdG6Io1DV-PJLhH1G5r9ugdEsNklpjjISOpU28dCy7N6vqoCr4ZWD-pEugq07Swsi-OWSIY2rEiDy1wAFNTYMzyUVrlHC4HxukKOu-uVI/w500-h306/LeTellier1657decode_small.png' itemprop='image_url'/>
<meta content='5107039156280592857' itemprop='blogId'/>
<meta content='3019612951370437107' itemprop='postId'/>
<a name='3019612951370437107'></a>
<h3 class='post-title entry-title' itemprop='name'>
<a href='https://cryptiana.blogspot.com/2026/09/solution-of-syllabic-cipher-le-tellier.html'>Solution of a Syllabic Cipher (Le Tellier-Castelnau Cipher, 1657)</a>
</h3>
<div class='post-header'>
<div class='post-header-line-1'></div>
</div>
<div class='post-body entry-content' id='post-body-3019612951370437107' itemprop='description articleBody'>
<p><br />An undeciphered letter from Le Tellier to Marquis de Castelnau, dated 12 May 1657, is presented in <a href="https://cryptiana.web.fc2.com/code/louisxiv0.htm#SEC6">"Ciphers Early in the Reign of Louis XIV"</a>. From other letters in Le Tellier's correspondence at the time, it is considered to be in a syllabic cipher. The ciphertext spanning a little over half a page seemed too short for a conventional solver for general syllable assignment. </p>
<p>To my pleasant surprise, it was solved by Robert Pitt. I guess the regularity of the assignment was given as a constraint or training data. The solution is described in a new short article, <a href="https://cryptiana.web.fc2.com/code/letellier.htm">"Solution of Le Tellier-Castelnau Cipher (1657)"</a>.</p><p><br /></p><div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;"><a href="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0N__rYpJ03Mi81jMYTz35HZk0MQKpkZRPIIrwhwYpBuvQpOH0F04_lMid-7N7mg2xaCik2_CKHXyxkFPAUgYdG6Io1DV-PJLhH1G5r9ugdEsNklpjjISOpU28dCy7N6vqoCr4ZWD-pEugq07Swsi-OWSIY2rEiDy1wAFNTYMzyUVrlHC4HxukKOu-uVI/s541/LeTellier1657decode_small.png" imageanchor="1" style="margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><img border="0" data-original-height="331" data-original-width="541" height="306" src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0N__rYpJ03Mi81jMYTz35HZk0MQKpkZRPIIrwhwYpBuvQpOH0F04_lMid-7N7mg2xaCik2_CKHXyxkFPAUgYdG6Io1DV-PJLhH1G5r9ugdEsNklpjjISOpU28dCy7N6vqoCr4ZWD-pEugq07Swsi-OWSIY2rEiDy1wAFNTYMzyUVrlHC4HxukKOu-uVI/w500-h306/LeTellier1657decode_small.png" width="500" /></a></div><p></p>

<div style='clear: both;'></div>
</div>
<div class='post-footer'>
